      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Same as my Sentinels thread, I asked&nbsp;talktotransformer.com to suggest some new Spirits.&nbsp; Copying and pasting from the wiki, I tried both with and without the complexity levels.&nbsp; Without complexities:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Vital Strength of the Earth</strong>-Dragon<br />\r\nWalking Wildshard<br />\r\nZap!<br />\r\nWind's Winds of Darkness<br />\r\nWrath of the Mountain Dragon<br />\r\nWhirling Death<br />\r\nBlades of the Mountain Dragon<br />\r\nHexblade of the Sun Dragon<br />\r\nShimmering Thunder<br />\r\nBloodborne's Stormbound Dragon</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With the complexities, the net went a little meta:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Unseen Power of the Shadow SubwayLDEGAMERATE<br />\r\nVile Darkness Incarnate of the Serpent, Fire, and Airtransitional (Mature)<br />\r\nWARNING<br />\r\nThe following characters are not intended to be sexually explicit for those that have been warned:<br />\r\nThe following characters have strong sexual and/or non-sexual themes. A child (17+) may be shown using the character set as an adult. The only character that is not required to be a minor to read this book is the Shadow.<br />\r\nThis is a work in progress, so the art can be tweaked in the future as we see fit.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hm... what about with the Jagged Earth spirits as prompts?&nbsp; Turns out that inspired poetry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Volcano Looming High</strong>&nbsp;and Unstoppable<br />\r\nErupt of the Flame<br />\r\nWaking from the Grave<br />\r\nFade away into the Dark<br />\r\nDawn's Breath<br />\r\nGods that Speak<br />\r\nCurse of the Void<br />\r\nTainted by the Sea<br />\r\nBeneath the Sea<br />\r\nThe Void is not what you think<br />\r\nAnd the tides that seem never to end<br />\r\nBut the endless dark knows no other tides<br />\r\nAnd those in its path can only follow, but never go<br />\r\nThe sea rises and the sky falls<br />\r\nClimbing Up the Tower<br />\r\nLaughing the Sea<br />\r\nShadows Unbound<br />\r\nThe Void is not what you think<br />\r\nAnd the tides that seem never to end<br />\r\nBut the endless dark knows no other tides<br />\r\nAnd those in its path can only follow, but never go<br />\r\nThe sea rises and the sky falls<br />\r\nClimbing Up the Tower<br />\r\nLaughing the Sea<br />\r\nShadows Unbound<br />\r\nBeneath the Sea<br />\r\nThe Void is not what you think!</p>",
