      "created_at": "2019-06-05T00:34:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh, and the list of Scenarios came out&nbsp;<em>great</em>:</p>\n<p>Hematite Storm<br>\nEnraged Demons<br>\nDark Force<br>\nDrowning Earth<br>\nShadow Demon<br>\nVicious Demon<br>\nSearing Demons<br>\nHellfire<br>\nA Soul Bound<br>\nVampire<br>\nTombstone<br>\nThe Dark Dimension<br>\nThe Great Forest<br>\nIn the Dark<br>\nInexorable Force<br>\nThe Dark Dimension<br>\nHell's Edge<br>\nAscendant Land<br>\nBlistering Hell<br>\nDemon's Realm<br>\nChaos Realm<br>\nDestructive Chaos<br>\nScythe of the Black Flame<br>\nEtcher's Eye<br>\nAscending Dark<br>\nInheritance, Wrath, and Chaos<br>\nThe Great Ocean<br>\nAscending Dark<br>\nAncestral Realm<br>\nDark Realm<br>\nHell's Edge<br>\nThe Great Forest<br>\nLava Sea<br>\nThe Great Forest<br>\nFire Hell's Edge<br>\nThe World from Beyond<br>\nThe Great Forest<br>\nWarp Storm<br>\nBolster the Alliance<br>\nAscending Hell's Edge<br>\nCurse of Eternity<br>\nDestructive Chaos<br>\nDivide, Sustain, and Conquer<br>\nInexorable Darkness<br>\nCurse of the Fallen Throne<br>\nHell</p>",
